    // ---------------- MIXER CHANNEL EQS (SSL 4000 style: LF shelf, LMF bell, HMF bell, HF shelf) ----------------
    // Channel order: 0 Osc, 1 Sub, 2 Noise, 3 Supersaw, 4 Sampler 1, 5 Sampler 2, 6 Wavetable 1, 7 Wavetable 2, 8 Wavetable 3
    // Osc channel
